goQ(){return"uninstalling the app"},
goB(){return"This page is a privacy explanation TruthLens wrote to reflect its actual functional behavior, not a lawyer-reviewed formal legal document; for a formal compliance review under the laws of your region, please consult independent legal counsel."},
goU(){return'Overview (maps to the App Store Privacy "Nutrition Label")'},
